url: "https://github.com/vugarfamiloglu/promptcrafter"
abstract: >-
  PromptCrafter is a local-first workbench that turns a one-sentence task
  description into either a Claude-grade XML prompt or a paste-and-run CLI
  skill for Claude Code, Windows PowerShell, or Windows Command Prompt.
  Built with Next.js, SQLite, and an AES-256-GCM-encrypted local key vault;
  works with OpenAI, Anthropic, or Google Gemini provider keys, plus
  OpenAI Whisper for voice input.
